{"title":"Accessories","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"caiden","title":"Caiden Warrior \u0026 Fighter","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is designed to deliver dependable performance, excellent cue ball control, and consistent playability. Constructed from premium multi-layer leather, it provides a solid, responsive hit with enhanced chalk retention to help minimize miscues and maximize shot accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for durability and consistency, the Caiden Warrior maintains its shape through extended play, making it an excellent choice for players seeking reliable performance at an exceptional value. Available in multiple hardness options to suit every playing style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent chalk retention for improved grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent feel and reliable cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with long-lasting shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater confidence on every shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSuper Soft (SS), Soft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recreational, league, and competitive players looking for a durable, high-performance cue tip that offers excellent control, consistency, and value.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442232426544,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442232459312,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Soft","offer_id":43442232492080,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/1b0b28b5-ca6b-4544-a6d8-01120f4ee9a3.png?v=1786676226"},{"product_id":"taom-pro","title":"Taom Pro","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eTaom Pro Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is designed for players who value precision, consistency, and a clean, controlled hit. Crafted from premium multi-layer leather, it delivers exceptional cue ball control, excellent chalk retention, and a consistent feel throughout its lifespan.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for long-lasting performance, the Taom Pro maintains its shape and firmness over extended play, helping reduce miscues while providing the confidence needed for accurate position play and spin. Whether you're competing in tournaments or enjoying league matches, the Taom Pro offers the reliability trusted by serious players.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent chalk retention for consistent performance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecise cue ball control and enhanced spin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with superior shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent feel from the first shot to the last\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for improved shot confidence\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e League, competitive, and professional players looking for a premium cue tip that delivers reliable performance, excellent control, and long-lasting durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442236981296,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442237014064,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Soft","offer_id":43442237046832,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_07_53_02PM.png?v=1785326039"},{"product_id":"turning-point-chalk","title":"Turning Point Chalk","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eTurning Point 7500 Professional Billiard Chalk\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience next-level cue control with the \u003cstrong\u003eTurning Point 7500 Professional Billiard Chalk\u003c\/strong\u003e. Engineered with exclusive \u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Particle Fusion Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines multiple particle sizes to create an ultra-fine 7500-mesh formula that delivers exceptional grip, smooth application, and consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for players of every skill level, TP 7500 adheres evenly to all cue tips—including playing, break, and jump cues—to help reduce miscues while maximizing spin, accuracy, and confidence on every shot. Its premium formulation provides long-lasting coverage with minimal chalking, while the compact protective case keeps your chalk clean and ready for competition. \u003cspan class=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUltra-fine \u003cstrong\u003e7500-mesh\u003c\/strong\u003e professional formula\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExclusive \u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Particle Fusion Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent grip for enhanced spin and cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHelps reduce miscues and improve shot consistency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with all cue tip types, including break and jump cues\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth, even application with long-lasting adhesion\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium protective case for convenient storage and portability \u003cspan class=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Competitive players, league players, and professionals seeking reliable chalk performance with outstanding control and consistency.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43442245402672,"sku":null,"price":2300.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_08_09_42PM.png?v=1785327043"},{"product_id":"kamui-athlete","title":"Kamui Athlete","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is engineered for players who demand precision, consistency, and confidence under pressure. Developed with Kamui's advanced leather technology, the Athlete series delivers exceptional cue ball control, reliable feedback, and long-lasting performance for today's competitive game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned to maintain its shape while providing excellent chalk retention, the Kamui Athlete minimizes miscues and offers a consistent hit throughout its lifespan. Whether you're executing powerful break shots or precise positional play, this tip provides the control and responsiveness needed to perform at your best.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutstanding chalk retention for enhanced grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent hit with excellent cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with superior shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater shot confidence\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for recreational, league, and professional players\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Players seeking a premium cue tip that delivers exceptional consistency, precision, and dependable performance in every match.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442245664816,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442245697584,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_08_15_52PM.png?v=1785327366"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/collections\/accessories.oembed","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}